# Secret Guard — known secrets to redact from context.
# One KEY=VALUE per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Any value 8+ characters long is redacted from tool output, commands, and
# messages before they are sent to the model or written to disk.
#
# Add your real secrets here (keys are documentation; the VALUES are redacted):

# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_exampletoken
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=wJalrXUtnFEMI/K7MDENG/bPxRfiCYEXAMPLEKEY
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:hunter2@db.example.com/app
